# demand_multi_adorn_witness -- the oracle's input batch (the SAME edge stream
# the driver sends). One epoch. The oracle evaluates the plain (undemanded)
# program; `q` is the full (A,B) copy of `edge_2`, subsuming both bf/fb probe
# answers by inspection.
batch
+ edge_2 1 2
+ edge_2 1 3
+ edge_2 2 4
+ edge_2 10 11
+ edge_2 11 12
end
